DreamLayoutContainer:SetAnimationHandler {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayout.h#DreamLayoutContainer:SetAnimationHandler
    src   "The property setter behind AnimationHandler, so writing it from Blueprint goes through the same\npath an author gets from the details panel instead of dropping a handler in with nothing told\nthat it changed. SetLayoutAnimation is the older name and stays; this forwards to it."
    text  "AnimationHandler 背后的属性设置器，因此从蓝图写入它会走与作者从细节面板获得的相同\n路径，而不是直接塞入一个处理程序，\n却不告知它已更改。SetLayoutAnimation 是旧名称，予以保留；此属性会转发到它。"
    state machine
}

